<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">初音未来 (初音ミク)</ttm:name></ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"><ttm:name type="full">和声</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>れるりり</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">诸事都不遂心愿</text><text for="L2">自我厌弃得不行</text><text for="L3">众神皆具痛苦与悲楚</text><text for="L4">我为逃脱这些而寻找避难所</text><text for="L5">干脆藏进岩石缝隙里</text><text for="L6">无视日升月落大睡一场</text><text for="L7">我的诞生有何意义</text><text for="L8">我不记得 也不知道</text><text for="L9">但就是因为你能这样思考</text><text for="L10">才让你</text><text for="L11">变得越来越出色</text><text for="L12">拥有越来越强大的力量</text><text for="L13">是啊 随神之侧 听神之命</text><text for="L14">所有人都深爱着地球</text><text for="L15">饮酒欢歌热热闹闹</text><text for="L16">偶尔一次未尝不可</text><text for="L17">是啊无论南北左右</text><text for="L18">大家都深爱着地球</text><text for="L19">即使满身污泥也能前进无阻</text><text for="L20">未来还有很长的路要走</text><text for="L21">只是想做个正义之人</text><text for="L22">肯定谁都是这样希望的</text><text for="L23">但每一天还是苦于应付</text><text for="L24">众神心中的丑恶</text><text for="L25">我能降生于世</text><text for="L26">说是奇迹倒是好听</text><text for="L27">但肯定只是一场偶然</text><text for="L28">根本没有什么意义吧</text><text for="L29">但若是</text><text for="L30">有人欺负你</text><text for="L31">那就是在告诉你</text><text for="L32">你是个超级大好人哦</text><text for="L33">是啊 随神之侧 听神之命</text><text for="L34">所有人都深爱着地球</text><text for="L35">我欢笑你也欢笑</text><text for="L36">就没有什么事不能原谅了</text><text for="L37">是啊无论男女都当谈恋爱</text><text for="L38">地球就是这样运转起来的</text><text for="L39">即使满身污泥也能前进无阻</text><text for="L40">未来还有很长的路要走</text><text for="L41">其实珍贵的事意外地</text><text for="L42">就存在于无聊琐事之中</text><text for="L43">有些时候大家就来闹一场</text><text for="L44">敞开胸襟博得大笑</text><text for="L45">是啊 随神之侧 听神之命</text><text for="L46">就能越发珍爱自己哦</text><text for="L47">你看看镜子里</text><text for="L48">这下知道了吧</text><text for="L49">那里有普照众生的光芒</text><text for="L50">是啊 随神之侧</text><text for="L51">感谢大家</text><text for="L52">我果然是爱着地球的</text><text for="L53">便令花朵绽开吧</text><text for="L54">无比广大的花 大到能够到天界</text><text for="L55">(La la la)</text><text for="L56">(La la la)</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:23.441" end="0:26.585" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:23.441" end="0:23.778">思</span><span begin="0:23.778" end="0:23.986">い</span><span begin="0:23.986" end="0:24.401">通</span><span begin="0:24.401" end="0:24.601">り</span><span begin="0:24.601" end="0:24.821">に</span><span begin="0:24.821" end="0:25.041">い</span><span begin="0:25.042" end="0:25.217">か</span><span begin="0:25.217" end="0:25.401">な</span><span begin="0:25.401" end="0:25.513">い</span><span begin="0:25.586" end="0:25.769">こ</span><span begin="0:25.769" end="0:25.905">と</span><span begin="0:25.985" end="0:26.137">だ</span><span begin="0:26.137" end="0:26.385">ら</span><span begin="0:26.385" end="0:26.585">け</span></p><p begin="0:27.337" end="0:30.218" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.337" end="0:27.484">ど</span><span begin="0:27.484" end="0:27.631">う</span><span begin="0:27.632" end="0:27.792">し</span><span begin="0:27.840" end="0:28.016">よ</span><span begin="0:28.016" end="0:28.192">う</span><span begin="0:28.192" end="0:28.360">も</span><span begin="0:28.441" end="0:28.624">な</span><span begin="0:28.624" end="0:28.792">く</span><span begin="0:28.976" end="0:29.156">自</span><span begin="0:29.376" end="0:29.585">己</span><span begin="0:29.760" end="0:29.960">嫌</span><span begin="0:29.960" end="0:30.218">悪</span></p><p begin="0:30.421" end="0:33.716" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:30.421" end="0:30.582">八</span><span beg