<span begin="0:52.996" end="0:53.307">風</span><span begin="0:53.307" end="0:53.507">に</span><span begin="0:53.699" end="0:54.051">思</span><span begin="0:54.228" end="0:54.420">え</span><span begin="0:54.611" end="0:54.867">る</span><span begin="0:54.867" end="0:55.123">っ</span><span begin="0:55.123" end="0:55.307">て</span><span begin="0:55.468" end="0:55.635">こ</span><span begin="0:55.635" end="0:55.814">と</span></p><p begin="0:56.955" end="1:00.330" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.955" end="0:57.131">そ</span><span begin="0:57.131" end="0:57.323">れ</span><span begin="0:57.323" end="0:57.540">は</span><span begin="0:58.884" end="0:59.211">君</span><span begin="0:59.211" end="0:59.428">が</span><span begin="0:59.595" end="0:59.699">も</span><span begin="0:59.700" end="0:59.804">っ</span><span begin="0:59.804" end="0:59.963">と</span><span begin="1:00.044" end="1:00.139">も</span><span begin="1:00.139" end="1:00.234">っ</span><span begin="1:00.235" end="1:00.330">と</span></p><p begin="1:00.330" end="1:04.026" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.330" end="1:00.507">素</span><span begin="1:00.507" end="1:00.939">敵</span><span begin="1:00.939" end="1:01.131">に</span><span begin="1:01.323" end="1:01.506">な</span><span begin="1:01.506" end="1:01.682">れ</span><span begin="1:01.682" end="1:01.828">る</span><span begin="1:01.946" end="1:02.571">力</span><span begin="1:02.762" end="1:03.030">が</span><span begin="1:03.030" end="1:03.298">あ</span><span begin="1:03.298" end="1:03.467">る</span><span begin="1:03.467" end="1:03.636">っ</span><span begin="1:03.636" end="1:04.026">て</span></p><p begin="1:04.530" end="1:07.459" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.530" end="1:04.891">教</span><span begin="1:04.963" end="1:05.139">え</span><span begin="1:05.139" end="1:05.298">て</span><span begin="1:05.386" end="1:05.694">る</span><span begin="1:05.694" end="1:06.002">ん</span><span begin="1:06.002" end="1:06.186">だ</span><span begin="1:06.330" end="1:07.459">よ